  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Wolf Guard Headtakers",
    "summary": "As the battle begins, pick a unit in your opponent's army as this unit's quarry. Attacks against its quarry by weapons of this unit's **HEADTAKERS** models get **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)** and **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)**. Whenever its quarry is destroyed, pick another enemy unit as its new quarry.\n\nThis ability works even while this unit is [embarked](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) in a **TRANSPORT**.",
